---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — MovieQuiz" description="Privacy Policy for MovieQuiz" noindex>
  <Header />
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: September 2026</p>

      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>MovieQuiz is designed with privacy in mind. You do not need to create an account, provide an email, or share any personal information to use our quizzes.</p>

      <h2>What We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect minimal data necessary to operate the service:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Anonymous identifier:</strong> We use your IP address to enforce our daily generation limit (3 AI results per day) and prevent abuse. We do not store your full IP address permanently.</li>
        <li><strong>Quiz answers:</strong> Your quiz answers are processed to calculate your result and are not stored separately.</li>
        <li><strong>Generated results:</strong> Your quiz result, AI-generated text, and AI-generated image are stored so you can access and share your unique result URL.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What We Do Not Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>No accounts or email addresses</li>
        <li>No names or personal identifiers</li>
        <li>No tracking cookies for advertising</li>
        <li>No browsing history</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>AI Generation</h2>
      <p>When you complete a quiz, we use Cloudflare Workers AI to generate personalized text and a unique cinematic image. Your quiz answers are sent to the AI model to generate your result. This data is processed in real-time and not retained by the AI provider beyond what is necessary for the generation.</p>

      <h2>Data Storage</h2>
      <p>Generated results are stored in Cloudflare D1 (metadata) and Cloudflare R2 (images). This includes your result text, traits, and generated image. This data is associated with a random result ID, not with your identity.</p>

      <h2>Sharing</h2>
      <p>When you share your result, the unique result URL is publicly accessible. Anyone with the link can view your result. The URL contains a random ID and does not reveal your identity.</p>

      <h2>Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Generated results are retained indefinitely so shared links continue to work. Rate limit data is retained for up to 24 hours.</p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>MovieQuiz is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect data from children.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, please contact us through our website.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 80px 0 60px;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 60px);
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .updated {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 32px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
  p {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  ul {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }
</style>
